We don’t add dependencies for novelty. We ask: *Does this solve a real team bottleneck in <2 weeks?* If yes, we spike it with a locked, minimal setup—Dockerfile, lockfile, one test. If it fails to deliver value in a sprint, it’s dead. No exceptions.  
This keeps our velocity high and our tech debt visible. No more "maybe" libraries. Just outcomes.

